    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77422" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰν-ήμερος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			= foreg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκλητος ἕρπων
			δαιταλεὺς π.</span>, of Prometheus' eagle, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Pr.</u>
			1024
		</span></i>: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανημερόν</span> (oxyt.) as
			Adv., <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			7.183
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Max.
			107
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς π.</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πανάμαρος</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανάμερος</span> is prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανίμερος</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				660
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
